{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act54side_level_act54side_st01","storyGroup":"act54side","storySort":1,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SR-ST-1","storyName":"月落","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"来自不同世界的少年结城理误入了葬礼经纪吉阿达和派对设计师裘里奥争执的现场，两人正在筹备一场葬礼。在他们的帮助下，结城理顺利在这个叫做拉特兰的城市安顿了下来……","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act54side/level_act54side_st01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act54side_st01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"next":1,"characters":["裘里奥","吉阿达","？？？","结城理","执行者"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"sticker","id":9,"multi":"true","text":"今天，我把啤酒杯送给了楼下的卡罗叔叔。他记性太坏，隔两周就要问一次杯子是从哪家工坊买的。","x":"300","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":10,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n我当然没想瞒他，但那家工坊的老板绝不愿意做两个相同的杯子，这我可没办法。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":12},{"type":"sticker","id":13,"multi":"true","text":"把杯子送给他之前，我找他要了一杯免费的酒作为交换。卡罗满面笑容地——","x":"300","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":14,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n他满面笑容地、尴尬地眯起了一只眼，用一种不同寻常的低声调，偷偷摸摸、不好意思地问我：","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":15,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“你今天想喝什么？”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":17},{"type":"sticker","id":18,"multi":"true","text":"我肯定是笑了，他看起来松了一口气，说：“这么说，你好多了？那来一杯黄油薄巧热奶啤，五份糖？”","x":"300","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":19,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n我说好，到畅饮台拿了一个厚纸杯，把这杯免费的酒端回了家。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":21},{"type":"sticker","id":22,"multi":"true","text":"天色暗了，月光落进窗户，像冰一片片堆叠。饮料冒出的热气越来越薄，月光里的屋子却像是越来越烫，让我想起那一天。","x":"300","y":"250","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":23,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n那一天，无尽的热切的感情烘烤着我的心，就像煎锅里的黄油一样，它幸福地融化了。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":24,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n歌声在耳边轻哼，我啜饮甜蜜的液体，“啦啦啦，啦啦……”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“从前……河流……山麓……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":28},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“大地的各处……都已见识……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":29},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0.8","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_bg_ibtownd.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":31},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":32},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“……伊比利亚的盐滩……萨尔贡的沙砾……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":34},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_bg_bg_desert_1.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":35},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":37},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_1.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":38},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":39},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“……哥伦比亚的冷风……去年的草根……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":41},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_bg_28_g3_slumstreets_night.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":42},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":43},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“莱塔尼亚酒馆里……踏步舞声永不息……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":45},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_bg_bg_23_G01.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":46},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":47},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“卡西米尔骄阳如剑……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":49},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_bg_iceforest_2.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":50},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":51},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“乌萨斯的春天雪水沸腾作炊烟……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":53},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_bg_26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":54},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"-100","duration":"40","block":"false","id":55},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“最后我来到拉特兰……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":56},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“没有地方可与拉特兰相比。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":57},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“糖与铳与信心……”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":58},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我将拉特兰一饮而尽。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"25","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":59},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"subtitle","id":61},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_bg_26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":65},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0.8","to":"0","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":69,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_26_g9_laterano_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":73},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"charslot","id":78},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":82},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"background","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","posfrom":"40,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"送到了！只是迟了二十分钟而已，我们有一整个上午呢。就当是多看了一个被否决的选项好啦！","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"“多看了一个被否决的选项”，这就叫做浪费时间吧？","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"没说不是……","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"但比起骂我还是先来看看东西吧不然浪费的时间就更多了对不对吉阿达小姐！","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……请介绍吧，裘里奥先生。不用炫耀你的语速，你没有在主持派对，我也没有这么急。","id":110},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"charslot","id":114},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":115},{"type":"multiline","name":"吉阿达","text":"鉴于你说你花了整整六天在这件事情上，","id":116},{"type":"multiline","name":"吉阿达","text":"我很期待。","id":117},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.9","yScale":"1.9","screenadapt":"coverall","id":119},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-400","xTo":"-550","y":"-360","duration":"40","block":"false","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我知道你不是真心的，但是没关系。我们就从四轮驱动带可调节雨篷的这一款开始吧！","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"不好意思？","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"dialog","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_awning_adjust","volume":"1","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"四轮驱动，驾驶座椅附带可调节雨蓬，十二岁以上皆可驾驶，虽然速度最高只有每小时二十五公里……","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"但我觉得这也是优点，再快的话来宾就需要有执照才能驾驶了。","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你还打算让他们驾驶？","id":130},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"唔，其实我是觉得来宾可以坐在驾驶席上和姨妈合影，你不觉得效果会很好吗？","id":131},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"至于要不要开放给来宾驾驶，如果你赞同的话……","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":133},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"好的，你不赞同，明白了！","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":139},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"下一个。","id":140},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":143},{"type":"background","xScale":"2","yScale":"2","screenadapt":"coverall","id":144},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"100","xTo":"380","yTo":"50","duration":"40","block":"false","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_brilliant_appearance","volume":"1","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"“杯糕小子”等身雕像！陪伴我长大，想必也陪伴了我姨妈甚至奶奶长大的甜品牌子！而且确认过，有正版授权。","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……好吧，杯糕小子主题的款式我见过，但一般只是印制图案，你这一件……","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我托了四层关系才找到的艺术家怎么会做那种量产品。这个等比例雕像款只此一件，更特别的是——","id":151},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_statue_open","volume":"1","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"看，雕像是可以打开的，内部贴合身体，四肢可动，可遥控可编程。","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"如果你想的话，我们可以让它在现场跳一曲《薇拉·珍》，我很喜欢那首歌，我觉得姨妈也……","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.6","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":161},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":162},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.9","yScale":"1.9","screenadapt":"coverall","id":163},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-650","duration":"0","block":"false","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-130,-250","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.4","duration":"0","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"好的，你不想，明白了。","id":168},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"那下一个……","id":169},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.6","grad":"true","fadetime":"0.5","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":173},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-650","xTo":"0","duration":"0","block":"false","id":174},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":179},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.01","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":180},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.6","fillto":"0.01","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":181},{"type":"delay","tim":"0.5","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_button","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":185},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_circulating_refrigeration_loop","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"cold","id":186},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"all","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"喔！是吉阿达小姐喜欢的体现功能性的设计——保鲜盒造型，而且真的能保鲜！内置莱塔尼亚产冰冻源石技艺模块，四循环制冷。","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"透明材质也很方便让姨妈和宾客合影！考虑到内部设计，可能要挑选一下放进棺材的遗物……","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"哦，原来你还记得我们是在选棺材。","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_button","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":202},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cold","fadetime":"1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"把遗体放在保鲜盒里，还有内部设计……什么设计呢，把它变成豆乳萨科塔盒子吗？","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":205},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"好主意！","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":207},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"……我猜你想听的回答不是这个。","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"拜托，吉阿达小姐，你能为我的派对着想一下吗？作为场地布置的核心，棺材的款式基本决定了整个派对场地的风格，这很重要。","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"首先，是“葬礼”场地，不是“派对”场地，葬礼才是这场仪式的本质。派对只是附加部分，裘里奥先生，就算没有也无妨……","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"不不不，必须有，你很清楚——合法遗嘱，公证所强制执行，执行者为此专门把我从哥伦比亚拎回拉特兰。","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"律法在上，在姨妈的葬礼上办好这场派对就是我人生中最重要的事！——至少在这一个月里是。","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我不是拒绝这场派对，我是说在性质上“派对”不是葬礼必需的部分……","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"吉阿达小姐，我知道你很在乎这场葬礼，我知道黎博利要当上葬礼经纪肯定不容易，见到你之前，我都不知道黎博利还能做葬礼经纪……","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"（深呼吸）","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"——抱歉！抱歉！我又说错话了是不是，你生气了？","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我没有。","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"multiline","name":"吉阿达","text":"而且这不重要。我知道你需要鼓捣一些……","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":228},{"type":"multiline","name":"吉阿达","text":"嗯……有趣的东西，","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"multiline","name":"吉阿达","text":"这是你的工作，我没意见。","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"但我希望裘里奥先生能理解，棺木与死者首先是葬礼的中心，然后才是你的……派对舞台上的，设施。","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你不用这么紧张地看着我……这是我独立负责的第一场葬礼没错，但我也是拉特兰人，我知道拉特兰葬礼的风格。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":236},{"type":"multiline","name":"吉阿达","text":"但我们完全可以选择一些更加……适中的选项，对吧？","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"multiline","name":"吉阿达","text":"比如，我看看……","id":239},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"这个巧克力曲奇造型的棺材就挺不错，也没有什么特殊功能，你不觉得这样就刚好吗？","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"可是这个只是工坊送过来推销的流行款……","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"你的第一场葬礼，不想来点更特别的东西吗，吉阿达小姐？","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"不是我的葬礼……","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"算了，我看今天也不可能在棺材问题上达成共识。我先找你问清楚另一件事。","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你之前设计的那个“宾客入场方式”——","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"坐滑梯滑进装满波波球的礼物盒里，把波波球扔进外面的筐里，按扔球的结果抽奖——","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我还没同意吧？","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"为什么礼物盒已经做好了？","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"吉阿达满面无奈地指向摆在准备室角落里，和充气儿童泳池差不多大小、蛋糕造型的礼物盒。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"噢，原来你看到了！我本来想等棺材定下来了就来说这件事，你之前不是说不太理解吗，我打算给你现场演示——","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":265},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","volume":"1","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"像是在配合裘里奥“现场演示”的宣言，“蛋糕”的顶部突然动了一下。","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……这个礼物盒，是电动的？","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"应该不是吧……给工坊下订单的时候没提这要求呀，这个盖子也不用开很多次……","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"呃，我过去看看……？","id":274},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":277},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","volume":"1","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"然而他一步也走不动，因为吉阿达紧紧拽住了他的袖子，无助地盯着那个礼物盒——它又在动了。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"有着精美裱花造型的盒盖又往上顶了一下，随后倾斜，滑落，拉出一道漫长尖锐的刮蹭声……","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"然后，两人都看到了那只伸出礼物盒的手。","id":282},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":285},{"type":"charslot","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pushcoffinlid","volume":"1","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":288},{"type":"image","image":"77_i01","xScale":"2.4","yScale":"2.4","screenadapt":"coverall","id":289},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"320","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-100","duration":"0","block":"false","id":290},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"320","xTo":"240","duration":"20","block":"false","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":293},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$farce_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_farce_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":294,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……这是……哪里？","id":295},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"image","image":"77_i01","xScale":"2.4","yScale":"2.4","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":297},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-620","yFrom":"0","yTo":"280","duration":"0","block":"false","id":298},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"-620","xTo":"-570","duration":"30","block":"false","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"陌生的地方……这里不是塔尔塔罗斯？","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"大家呢……？","id":303},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":305},{"type":"image","image":"77_i01","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","fadetime":"2.5","screenadapt":"coverall","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"于礼物盒中坐起的少年似乎还有些不适，皱着眉头望向四周——","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"三人面面相觑。","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……有人？不……那是光环……还有羽毛……吗？","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……裘里奥，这是你准备的吗？","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"什么准备，准备什么？这个孩子吗？","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"不不，我说的演示是我自己来的意思，我还不至于要把孩子关在礼物盒里来，呃……给你“惊喜”啊！","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（奇怪的语言……但能听懂……）","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（塔尔塔罗斯中的暗影……会说话吗？）","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你还好吗？","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……还好。","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"你是工坊的学徒吗？不小心把自己关进礼物盒里了？谢天谢地，这盒子不是密封的……","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"还是先出来吧，小子。我去给你倒杯热可可……呃，茶水间在哪，吉阿达？","id":320},{"type":"dialog","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"image","id":325},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#9$4","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":331},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……我理一理，意思是说，你叫结城理，和朋友一起来到拉特兰，在城外被野兽袭击了，醒来时就在这个盒子里了？","id":335},{"type":"charslot","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#9$4","focus":"m","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"（这里的情况……“拉特兰”也好，这两位也好……）","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"（在搞清楚状况之前，还是慎重一点吧。）","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……差不多是这样。","id":341},{"type":"charslot","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":343},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我检查了一下，似乎没见到其他的孩子。","id":345},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"也许是工坊的人救了他，回城时出了什么差错……","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……抱歉，两位，其实我还有些事情没明白。","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#13$4","focus":"m","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"我来到了……“拉特兰”，这部分明白了。但这里具体是……？","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#5$4","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"我似乎看到了很多游乐装置，这里是……主题乐园吗？你们两位是这里的工作人员……？","id":354},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"对外国人可能有点难理解……这些东西其实是，棺材……","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#13$4","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……葬礼用的那种？","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"嗯。这里是拉特兰新建的殡仪堂，我是在这里工作的葬礼经纪。","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我嘛，是派对设计师，现在算是临时在殡仪堂工作。","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我们确实正在准备一场葬礼，今天是要为葬礼选一副棺材。","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"发现你之前，我和吉阿达小姐正在为这件事吵架呢！","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"什么吵架？！我只是在和你讨论工作！","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#5$4","focus":"m","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"吵架不太好吧……","id":375},{"type":"charslot","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……抱歉，我不该在孩子面前发脾气。","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":380},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"噢噢，你承认自己在发脾气了——","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"欸，我有个想法！","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"理，你愿不愿意帮我们一个忙？","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"等会儿我来试用一下这些棺材，拜托你和吉阿达一起看一下效果——毕竟我自己躺进去就没法从观赏视角判断了嘛！","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"你一看就是诚实的孩子，一定会公正地判断对不对——","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"裘里奥，你在说什么胡话？现在应该赶紧送他去公证所。","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"直接送他去公证所吗？他是外国人，又没有身份证明，三天之内公证所就要遣送他出境了。","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……这和你要结城帮忙有什么关系？他还没有成年，即使你让他和我们一起工作，殡仪堂也不可能雇用他……","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"没那么复杂！只是一点点人与人之间的互相帮助——","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":397},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"理，如果你愿意帮我……","id":398},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":399},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"呃，帮我们的话，","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"我就和公证所说你是我的亲戚，怎么样？有公民做担保就可以留下了嘛。","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……你在教“诚实的孩子”对执行者撒谎？","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"要挟小孩子也太难看了。","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"要、要挟小孩子？！等一下，你怎么会理解成这样，我不是这个意思……","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#9$4","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"（虽然外貌有点奇特……但听起来，他们两位不是坏人。）","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"（“拉特兰”似乎是某个国家的名字，虽然完全没听说过……如果S.E.E.S.的同伴们也都误入了这里的话，得快点找到他们才行。）","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"好，我可以帮忙。","id":414},{"type":"charslot","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"结城，不用听他胡说，就算你不想帮忙，我也可以替你担保。其他的事之后再想办法。","id":418},{"type":"charslot","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#10$4","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"你们两位对我很亲切，如果有能帮得上忙的事，我很愿意去做。","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"之后请再和我介绍一下“公证所”的事，可以吗？","id":422},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"好呀好呀！吉阿达，你看，这就叫互相帮助嘛。","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":428},{"type":"charslot","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#10$4","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"我也很感谢吉阿达小姐。","id":431},{"type":"charslot","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你们两个……","id":435},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":436},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"好啦好啦，吉阿达，理，我们开工吧？我看看……","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":438},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"从名字叫“全速回归圣灵”的那一款开始好了！","id":439},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":443},{"type":"charslot","id":444},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_bg_26_g12_laterano_office.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":445},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":448,"musicid":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"好……基本信息登记完毕，这是你的临时认证码和终端。","id":451,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"下一步是，我看看……你们已经选好学校了吗，还是说结城同学自己选？","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"学校？","id":457},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……他只是来探亲，没有在拉特兰入学的打算。","id":459},{"type":"charslot","id":460},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"不可以哦。他还没有成年，你们登记的是“暂无离境计划”，那就必须要入学了。刚好现在是三月份，时机还不错。","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":463},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":464},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"没问题没问题！小孩子是应该上学才对，执行者先生方便让我看一下学校名单吗？","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":469},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"……唔……","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":471},{"type":"multiline","name":"裘里奥","text":"找到了！","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"圣马尔索综合学校，就这个吧。","id":473},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……你为什么专门翻到我的学校？","id":475},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"欸？这是我小时候读的学校啊。","id":477},{"type":"charslot","id":478},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"选好了？那我就录入了哦。请稍等一会儿。","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":481},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":482},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":483},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_bg_26_g12_laterano_office.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":484},{"type":"charslot","id":485},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","id":487},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":488},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"（小声）结城不是要去找同伴吗，上学还怎么找……","id":490},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"（小声）放学了找呀，实在不行还能翘课嘛。","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"（小声）理，你应该不是那种不敢翘课的好学生吧？翘课来殡仪堂帮忙也可以哦。","id":494},{"type":"charslot","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#5$4","focus":"m","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"（小声）我没有翘过课……只是偶尔上课睡觉。","id":497},{"type":"charslot","id":498},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":499},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"（小声）……既然去上学了就不许翘课，无论是翘课还是上课睡觉都不可以！","id":501},{"type":"dialog","id":502},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":503},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":504},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_bg_26_g12_laterano_office.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":505},{"type":"charslot","id":506},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"录入好了，学校那边也确认了，今天就可以去报到。","id":509,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"一开始我还以为这个孩子是来参加葬礼的呢，没想到是要在这边暂住啊。之前没听说维韦塔女士在东国也有亲戚呢。","id":511,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":512},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":513},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……您认识我姨妈？","id":515},{"type":"charslot","id":516},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"不认识，只是认识执行她遗嘱的同事，听说他从哥伦比亚带了一位派对设计师回来给维韦塔女士办葬礼……哦不，派对。","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":519},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":520},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……","id":522},{"type":"charslot","id":523},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"我还挺好奇的，那个遗嘱登记的时间是二十年前，那时候裘里奥先生才六岁吧？为什么她会指名你在她的葬礼上办派对呢？","id":525,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":526},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":527},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":528},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我……我也不记得了。","id":529},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"不好意思，执行者先生，我们可以走了吗？","id":531},{"type":"charslot","id":532},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_372_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":533},{"type":"dialogue","name":"执行者","text":"当然当然，一切顺利！记得给我好评哦~","id":534,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/24/Avg_avg_npc_372_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":535},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":536},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":537},{"type":"charslot","id":538},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_bg_26_g11_laterano_alley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":539},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":540},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":541},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":542},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"我现在要去的，是你们两位就读过的学校吗？","id":543},{"type":"charslot","id":544},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":545},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":546},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"是啊哈哈，还挺巧的，没想到和吉阿达小姐还是校友……完全想象不出吉阿达小姐穿我们学校校服的样子嘛。","id":547},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":548},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"确实没怎么穿过，我是便服上学派。","id":549},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":550},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"咦，我们学校可以这样……？","id":551},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":552},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你真的和我读过同一所学校？","id":553},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":554},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"真的呀真的呀，圣马尔索区的小孩基本都是读这间学校吧？我小时候就住这里啊。","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"圣马尔索区的主路经常有安魂教堂的仪柩车经过，坐在路边看，修士和家属的心情就会像风一样一阵一阵地拂过来……对不对？","id":556},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":557},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"好像是这样……以前大家要在城市停驻时去安魂教堂办葬礼……","id":558},{"type":"dialog","id":559},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"n","id":560},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":561},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","volume":"0.4","id":562},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_explosion","volume":"0.4","id":563},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":564},{"type":"charslot","id":565},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#3$4","focus":"m","id":566},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"什么声音？","id":567},{"type":"charslot","id":568},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":569},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":570},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"爆炸啊。","id":571},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":572},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"是圣罗可街吧，那边新开了一家泡芙店，人气很旺哦。","id":573},{"type":"dialog","id":574},{"type":"charslot","id":575},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bulletbarrage","volume":"0.4","id":576},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":577},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#13$4","focus":"m","id":578},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……你好冷静。而且刚才的声音又是……是枪声吗？","id":579},{"type":"charslot","id":580},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":581},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":582},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"对，快到学校了。","id":583},{"type":"charslot","id":584},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#13$4","focus":"m","id":585},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"……？","id":586},{"type":"charslot","id":587},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":588},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":589},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"那边的学生，应该是来接你的吧。","id":590},{"type":"dialog","id":591},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":592},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":593},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":594},{"type":"charslot","id":595},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.8","yScale":"1.8","screenadapt":"coverall","id":596},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-70","yFrom":"0","yTo":"-250","duration":"0","block":"false","id":597},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":598},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_avg3_act54side_intro","volume":"0.6","id":599,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":600},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"-250","yTo":"100","duration":"10","block":"false","id":601},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":602},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":603},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":604},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":605},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":606},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":607},{"type":"background","xScale":"1.9","yScale":"1.9","fadetime":"1.5","screenadapt":"coverall","id":608},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"0","xTo":"-250","yFrom":"0","yTo":"200","duration":"0","block":"false","id":609},{"type":"backgroundtween","xFrom":"-250","xTo":"-350","duration":"30","block":"false","id":610},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2377_1#4$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":611},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.4","duration":"0","id":612},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":613},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":614},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":615},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":616},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2377_1#8$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,30","duration":"0","focus":"r","id":617},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2377_1#8$1","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.4","duration":"0","id":618},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啊，来了！","id":619},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"同学，这边！","id":620},{"type":"dialog","id":621},{"type":"charslot","id":622},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.01","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":623},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","id":624},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0.01","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":625},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":626},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":627},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"1.5","id":628},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2377_1#2$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","focus":"m","id":629},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":630},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2377_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":631},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你好！请问，是结城理同学吗？","id":632},{"type":"dialog","id":633},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":634},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":635},{"type":"bgeffect","id":636},{"type":"gridbg","id":637},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":638},{"type":"image","id":639},{"type":"charslot","id":640}],"characters":["裘里奥","吉阿达","？？？","结城理","执行者"]}